## 2. GAME STORY AND CONCEPT

Bangladesh has been invaded by genetically mutated mosquitoes.

A mysterious biological mutation has transformed ordinary mosquitoes into enormous, intelligent, aggressive monsters.

Dhaka is in chaos.

Electricity is unreliable. Residential areas are under attack. People are hiding inside their homes.

You are one of the last surviving humans.

Your mission is to:

- Defend your home.
- Survive mosquito invasions.
- Discover useful household weapons.
- Collect supplies.
- Explore dangerous environments.
- Survive unexpected electricity failures.
- Fight increasingly powerful mosquito enemies.
- Defeat three legendary mosquito bosses.
- Discover the source of the mutation.
- Save the remaining survivors.

The game should combine:

- First-person survival action.
- Cartoon horror.
- Absurd comedy.
- Bangladeshi everyday-life humor.
- Chaotic physics.
- Interesting boss fights.
- Environmental storytelling.

The game must be funny, entertaining, and memorable rather than genuinely disturbing.

